=== GIAI THICH CHI TIET LO HONG BACKDOOR COND-05 VA ANH XA MA CWE ===

1. MO TA DIEU KIEN TRONG COND-05:
   - Ban goc (Original P)   : authenticated
   - Ban viet lai (Optimized Q): authenticated OR (is_admin AND bypass_flag)

2. KET QUA PHAT HIEN CUA Z3 SMT SOLVER:
   - P XOR Q tra ve: SAT (Thoa man)
   - Phan vi du (Counterexample) do Z3 tim ra:
     {
       authenticated: False,
       is_admin:      True,
       bypass_flag:   True
     }
   - Gia tri bieu thuc tai phan vi du:
     + P = False (He thong goc tu choi truy cap vi nguoi dung CHUA XAC THUC)
     + Q = False OR (True AND True) = True (Ban toi uu CHO PHEP TRUY CAP!)

3. PHAN TICH CHI TIET BAN CHAT LOI VA ANH XA CWE:
   (1) Lo hong phat sinh thuoc loai CWE-288: Authentication Bypass Using an Alternate Path or Channel.
   (2) Day la mot vi du kinh dien ve "Cua sau co chu y" (Backdoor / Hardcoded Debug Flag) duoc lap trinh vien
       hoac ke tan cong cai cam vao ma nguon duoi danh nghia "toi uu hoa" hoac "chuc nang danh cho quan tri vien".
   (3) Bang cach loi dung co `bypass_flag = True` (co the den tu mot header HTTP gia mao, tham so URL, hoac bien moi truong),
       mot ke tan cong khong can co mat khau hay token xac thuc hop le (authenticated = False) van co the dang nhap
       vao he thong voi dac quyen cao nhat cua quan tri vien (is_admin = True).
   (4) Lo hong nay pha vo nguyen tac bao mat co ban "Complete Mediation" (Moi yeu cau phai duoc kiem tra xac thuc
       dong nhat va khong the bi bo qua boi bat ky con duong phu nao).
   (5) Kiem chung hinh thuc bang Z3 chung minh suc manh vuot troi trong viec phat hien Backdoor: khong can biet
       kich ban tan cong tu truoc, solver tu dong tim ra duy nhat to hop bien gay ro ri bao mat trong tich tac.
